OL,3,GNEWSA'Don't call us snowflakes ` life
OL,4,Acan be challenging'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a term now so common that it
OL,7,Ffeatures in the Oxford English
OL,8,FDictionary.
OL,10,FSnowflake: an insult to describe
OL,11,Fsomeone who is overly sensitive or as
OL,12,Ffeeling entitled to special treatment
OL,13,For consideration.
OL,15,FBut Prof Peter Fonagy, the head of an
OL,16,Findependent review into mental health,
OL,17,FADHD and autism, said recently in an
OL,18,Fexclusive BBC interview that there had
OL,19,Fbeen a real rise in mental distress
OL,20,Famong children and young people, with
OL,21,Fanxiety, depression, self-harm and
OL,22,Feating disorders the most common.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
