OL,3,GNEWSA'Don't call us snowflakes ` life
OL,4,Acan be challenging'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow young people have told the BBC's
OL,7,FPolitics East programme they find being
OL,8,Fcalled snowflakes offensive, saying the
OL,9,Fterm dismisses the very real problems
OL,10,Fthey experience in the modern world.
